      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Upsert Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "upsert-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Sync Integration Configurations",
        "Upsert Integration Configurations"
      ],
      "Text": "Once a customer creates an integration requiring configuration, you must create the configuration using the following API before they can enable the integration.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Upsert Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "upsert-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Sync Integration Configurations",
        "Upsert Integration Configurations"
      ],
      "Text": "Values for the integration key are obtained via the ATS Integration Configuration Plugin when a customer enables integrations.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
